# protobuf pinned to the highest patched 4.25.x release: gencode in proto/**/*_pb2.py is
# "Protobuf Python Version: 4.25.1" and requirements-kms.in independently resolves protobuf
# 7.x for boto3/google-cloud-kms (separate lock file, not installed together) — bumping this
# pin to 5.x/6.x would require regenerating the committed _pb2 stubs. 4.25.9 clears
# PYSEC-2026-1806; PYSEC-2026-1805 has no fix in the 4.x line (needs 5.29.6+/6.33.5+) and is
# left as a flagged residual pending a coordinated stub regen.
protobuf==4.25.9
